Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: yt-dlp, mpv
Enhances: wmaker
Description: YouTube / PeerTube player dockapp for Window Maker
 wmtube streams a video into a 64x64 Window Maker dock tile, using libmpv
 for playback and yt-dlp to resolve YouTube, PeerTube and other video
 URLs. The 16:9 video fills a 56x32 band; the rows above and below can
 show a scrolling title and the elapsed / total play time in the classic
 LED dockapp style.
 .
 Controls are mouse only: pause, seek, volume, cycle the text rows, play a
 URL from the X selection, or open the video full size in mpv.
